@startuml
title Onsite Payment at Canteen using Card/QR (Swimlane Activity Diagram)

|Student|
start
:Choose food/drink or pay for services at canteen/library/sport grounds;

|Service POS (Canteen)|
:Select items on POS;
:POS calculates total;
:Inform student of total amount;
:Ask student to tap card or show wallet QR;

|Student|
:Tap student card on reader
or show wallet QR from mobile app;

|Service POS (Canteen)|
:Capture card UID or wallet QR token;
:Send payment request to Wallet System
(student identifier + amount + canteen POS id);

|Wallet System|
:Lookup wallet by cardUID/QR token;
if (Wallet exists AND Active?) then (yes)
  if (Balance >= amount?) then (yes)
    :Create payment transaction
    (type = SERVICE_PAYMENT, service = CANTEEN);
    :Deduct wallet balance;
    :Return "Payment SUCCESS" to POS;
  else (no)
    :Return "Insufficient balance" to POS;
  endif
else (no)
  :Return "Wallet not found / locked" to POS;
endif

|Service POS (Canteen)|
if (Payment SUCCESS?) then (yes)
  :Show "Paid" on POS;
  |Student|
  :Receive food/drink;
else (no)
  :Show error on POS;
  :Inform student (e.g. top-up or pay cash);
endif

stop
@enduml
